            <div xml:id="d589">

                <pb facs="0710" n="592" xml:id="pg592"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">821.6363/364: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Colombia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Piles</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Bogotá</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-02-22T09:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">February 22,
                                1928—9 a.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 12:15
                    p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>14. Conferred with President and Minister of Foreign Affairs February 21, 3 p.m.
                    [They?] intimated they would like informal memorandum points Department’s
                    telegram 9, February 18, 7 p.m. Is there any objection? Unfortunately home
                    papers published oil company’s objections and a way [<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >sic</hi>] which are repeated to unfriendly press here.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Piles</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
